# Files Docker may send to a build. Everything is left out except the files listed here,
# so a new secret or local file can't end up in an image by accident. .env stays out: the
# settings reach a container as environment variables when it runs.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!alembic/
!app/
!worker/
!scripts/__init__.py
!scripts/create_agent.py
!scripts/failed_jobs.py
!infra/aws/rds-ca-us-east-2.pem

# Python's caches, inside the folders allowed above.
**/__pycache__
